<view class="page">
  <view class="hd">
    <view class="title">绑定微信</view>
    <view class="sub">换设备也还在</view>
  </view>

  <view class="onboard-card">
    <view class="onboard-sub">
      绑定之后，本命档案跟着你走，不跟着这台手机
    </view>

    <view class="wx-form">
      <view class="wx-field">
        <button class="avatar-btn"
                open-type="chooseAvatar"
                bindchooseavatar="onChooseAvatar">
          <image wx:if="{{draft.avatar_url}}"
                 class="avatar-preview"
                 src="{{draft.avatar_url}}"
                 mode="aspectFill"/>
          <view wx:else class="avatar-preview avatar-fallback">选头像</view>
        </button>
      </view>

      <view class="wx-field">
        <input class="nickname-input"
               type="nickname"
               placeholder="微信昵称"
               value="{{draft.nickname}}"
               bindinput="onNickname"
               bindblur="onNickname"/>
      </view>

      <view class="wx-cta">
        <button class="btn" bindtap="doBind" disabled="{{binding}}">
          {{binding ? '绑定中…' : '绑定微信'}}
        </button>
      </view>

      <view class="wx-hint">
        我们不读取你的手机号或其它信息 · 只换一个微信给的匿名编号，再存你自己填的头像和昵称
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="acts">
    <button class="btn ghost" bindtap="onBack">回去</button>
  </view>
</view>
